{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-tsx-content-file-path-blog-posts-run-mc-server-mdx","path":"/posts/run-mc-server/","result":{"data":{"mdx":{"excerpt":"笔者在今年五月份部署了一个与朋友同玩共乐的 Minecraft 服务器，稳定运行至今。忽然想记录为一篇博客，分享分享折腾的经历。 笔者结合个人喜好（最新版本，模组优先）和大众推荐（Fabric 更适合新版本 Minecraft），决定基于 Fabric 搭建一个可以添加模组的 Minecraft 服务器。此类服务器简称为模组服务器，还有基于 Paper, Spigot 等搭建的插件服务器…","fields":{"isDraft":false},"frontmatter":{"description":null,"banner":{"publicURL":"/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/banner.jpg","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#e8e8e8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/3832f/banner.jpg","srcSet":"/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/fdd27/banner.jpg 480w,\n/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/93fdb/banner.jpg 960w,\n/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/3832f/banner.jpg 1920w","sizes":"(min-width: 1920px) 1920px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/a1501/banner.webp 480w,\n/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/55375/banner.webp 960w,\n/static/dc3226e21af923ff82bb5f707b658131/e4c47/banner.webp 1920w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 1920px) 1920px, 100vw"}]},"width":1920,"height":1440}}},"categories":["技术琐事"],"tags":["Linux","Minecraft","Game"],"title":"部署一个给朋友使用的 Minecraft 模组服务器","date":"2024-07-05T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-07-13T00:00:00.000Z","timeliness":null}}},"pageContext":{"id":"d844cb72-3f6e-58d8-bf2e-8fdbf54393d2","frontmatter":{"title":"部署一个给朋友使用的 Minecraft 模组服务器","date":"2024-07-05T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-07-13T00:00:00.000Z","banner":"./run-mc-server/banner.jpg","categories":["技术琐事"],"tags":["Linux","Minecraft","Game"]}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1663511934","2940271172"],"slicesMap":{}}